Subject: transcript markdown: the async parse renders math only

What: marked.tsx drops highlightCodeBlocks, ensureOpenCodeTheme and the OpenCode shiki
theme (marked-theme.tsx is deleted), markdownEnhances is math alone, and the kit no
longer depends on shiki.
Why: the app highlights every code block, nested ones included, through its worker; the
kit's main-thread shiki redrew a prose block holding nested code after its first paint
and grew it by 24 px.

